# 10. System / Error / Special Screens

## SYS01 — 404 / Not Found

Unknown route or unavailable resource.

## SYS02 — 403 / Unauthorized

Authenticated user lacks permission.

## SYS03 — 401 / Authentication Required

Protected resource requires authentication.

## SYS04 — Suspended / Inactive Account

Authenticated identity cannot currently use the application because account status is not active.

## SYS05 — Generic Application Error

Unexpected application failure.

## SYS06 — Network / API Failure

Frontend cannot reach or communicate with backend.

## SYS07 — AI Service Unavailable

AI capabilities unavailable while core deterministic functionality should remain usable where possible.

## SYS08 — AI Execution Failed

Shows execution failure, error category, retry where appropriate, execution status.

## SYS09 — AI Execution In Progress

Persistent asynchronous AI execution:

```text
QUEUED
 ↓
RUNNING
 ↓
COMPLETED / FAILED
```

Browser disconnection must not destroy the underlying execution.

## SYS10 — RAG / Document Processing State

```text
UPLOADED
PROCESSING
INDEXING
READY
FAILED
```

