# 12. Global Design Consistency Principle

> ## **GrowFlow has one application shell and one design language, with role-specific navigation and content—not three independent UI systems.**

```text
                 GROWFLOW DESIGN SYSTEM
                         │
              ┌──────────┼──────────┐
              ↓          ↓          ↓
           STUDENT     MENTOR     ADMIN
              │          │          │
              └──────────┼──────────┘
                         ↓
                  SAME VISUAL DNA
```

Roles differ in:

- Information
- Permissions
- Actions
- Density

They should not arbitrarily differ in:

- Basic visual language
- Shell
- Typography
- Spacing
- Interaction principles
- Component behavior

