# 13. Public Experience vs Application Experience

GrowFlow intentionally has two visual modes within one design language.

## Public Experience

```text
HIGH VISUAL IMPACT
HIGH MOTION
HIGH STORYTELLING
INTERACTIVE
SHOWCASE-ORIENTED
```

Applies especially to Landing, Features, Documentation, and any retained public architecture showcase.

## Application Experience

```text
INFORMATION DENSITY
CLARITY
PRODUCTIVITY
CONSISTENCY
LOW-FRICTION INTERACTION
CONTROLLED MOTION
```

Applies to Student, Mentor, and Admin.

The Dashboard should not behave like a marketing website. The Landing page can use dramatic architecture animations, while Project Workspace should remain precise, stable, and information-dense.

Goal:

> **Beautiful without sacrificing usability.**

